  "description": "The TPE tri-extruded composition ensures 100% safe, 100% odorless, and environmentally friendly in all weather (rain, fog, snow, etc). OEDRO floor liners are compatible with Dodge Ram 1500/2500/3500.\nFeatures\nAll-Weather Protection: Made from high-quality TPE material, OEDRO floor mats provide full coverage against rain, snow, mud, spills, and debris, keeping your vehicle’s interior clean in any season.\nDurable & Flexible Material: Constructed with tough TPE, these mats offer superior abrasion resistance and remain flexible in both hot and cold weather—outperforming traditional PVC alternatives.\nPrecision Fit: Each mat is custom-molded using advanced 3D laser scanning and computer design to perfectly match the contours of your vehicle’s floor for maximum coverage and a secure fit.\nAnti-Slip & Secure: Designed with raised ridges and a textured backing that grips the carpet, the mats stay firmly in place without shifting during driving.\nQuick & Easy Cleaning: Simply remove the mats, rinse off dirt or grime with water, let them dry, and reinstall—no scrubbing or special cleaners required.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible for 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic Crew Cab ( Classic Model ONLY, NOT for New Body ).\nCompatible with 2013-2018 Dodge Ram 1500/2500/3500 Crew Cab.",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
